@startuml UC-2.7_review_results
!theme plain

title Sailing Channel Dashboard Admin — UC-2.7 — Review Import Results

participant "Bulk Import\n[presentation]" as BulkImportUI
participant "Bulk Import Service\n[application]" as BulkImportSvc
actor "Owner / Super Admin /\nChannel Manager" as Actor

note over BulkImportUI
  Triggered after UC-2.5 commits
  the bulk import (steps 8–9).
end note

BulkImportSvc -> BulkImportUI : send results report
activate BulkImportUI

BulkImportUI -> BulkImportUI : generate results report\n(total rows, successfully added,\nsuccessfully reactivated,\nalready active, invalid handles,\nAPI errors, other errors,\nduplicate rows)

BulkImportUI -> BulkImportUI : display report;\nprovide row-level detail for\nunsuccessful operations

BulkImportUI --> Actor : show results report
deactivate BulkImportUI

Actor -> Actor : review import results

@enduml
